Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  有押韵的歌词  连我都没想过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, yeah, a song with rhyming words. Ooh, I never thought of that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我喜欢她{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么  因为她会唱歌  会弹吉他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why? Because she can sing and play guitar...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后将两个结合在一起{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and do both at the same time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我对这些人的期望  也大概就这么多{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, that's pretty much all I'm looking for from these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看看你  好嫉妒喔{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Look at you, all jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别这样  菲比 你们两人的风格完全不同{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, Pheebs, come on. You two have completely different styles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她比较这样… 而你是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, she's more... you know? And you're more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC2E0EC&\b0}Say you'll stay beside me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:01:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看吧  大家都很高兴她唱完了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay. See? See? Everybody else is happy she's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好  我下一首歌叫做{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, my next song's called:{\r}
