Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿   菲比{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, Phoebe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.07,0:02:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿   莱丝莉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, Leslie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你怎么知道我会在这里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How'd you know I'd be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在卖大鱼的地方  撞见弗拉德…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I ran into Vlad at the place where they sell the big fish...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他说你常在这里表演{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and he said you played here a lot, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}听好  我得去厕所{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. I have to go to the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果她们又提到大鱼那个地方…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But if the place with the big fish comes up again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想知道是有好几条大鱼  还是只有一条大鱼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I'd like to know whether that's several big fish or just one big fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}菲比说你会写广告歌{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So Phoebe tells us you write jingles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我其实是说她抛弃我  跑去写广告歌{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Actually, I said she abandoned me to write jingles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有没有我们听过的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, anything we might've heard of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, yeah, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  但是我不写了  我很厌倦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, but I don't do that anymore. I got kind of sick of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}也想不出好歌曲   所以被炒了鱿鱼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And then I couldn't come up with anything good, so they fired me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真惨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hmm, bummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}其实我…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, you know, I was just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在想说… 希望可以…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, I was just thinking and just hoping that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}或许你想跟我再次搭档{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...maybe you'd want to get back together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要  不过谢谢你的提议{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, but thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别这样  菲比  你可不可以考虑一下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, come on, Phoebe. Would you just think about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要  谢谢了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, but thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}再见了  菲比{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}See you, Pheebs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真是残忍{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow. That was kind of brutal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好  希望大家都能得到教训{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, okay. Let this be a lesson to all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吗  一旦背叛我  我就会变成冰雪女王{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right? Once you betray me, I become like the Ice Woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会非常冷淡  冷酷  绝不让步{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, I'm just very cold, hard, unyielding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有东西能穿透我冷硬的外壳{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, nothing, nothing can penetrate this icy exterior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}可以给我一张卫生纸吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Can I have a tissue, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有人在里面吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Is someone in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有  这只是一个冒险游戏…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. This is just part of a daredevil game...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:04:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}叫做 "等到我膀胱爆掉死去"{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...that I play called "Wait Until the Last Moment Before I Burst and Die."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊  你是掉到…  你好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Jeez, man. Did you fall...? Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有吗   你有掉到哪里去吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So, uh, did you? Did you fall high?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有人在女厕  我等不及{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Someone was in the ladies' room. I couldn't wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但是我把马桶盖掀起来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I left the lid up for you, though.  Ha, ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}噢  阿甘  你先去吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know what, uh, Gunther? Go, uh... Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在跟…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm talking to, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这时候你要说你的名字{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This is the part where you say your name.{\r}
